|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Basic screen definitions (e.g., title)
!|!
!|10000$-=TITLE=Example RIP Commands$
!|!
!|!
!|-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! What RIP file do we call from our demo screens to return here?
!|!
!|10000$-=RETURN=>TELCMDS.RET$
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Labels for each of the six buttons
!|!
!|10000$-=LAB1=Buttons$
!|10000$-=LAB2=Curves$
!|10000$-=LAB3=Fonts$
!|10000$-=LAB4=Images$
!|10000$-=LAB5=Markers$
!|10000$-=LAB6=Polygons$
!|10000$-=LAB7=PolyPolygon$
!|10000$-=LAB8=Shapes$
!|10000$-=LAB9=Special FX$
!|!             
!|! 
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Text variables to execute when one of the six buttons are clicked
!|!
!|10000$-=CMD1=>BUTTONS.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD2=>CURVES.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD3=>FONTS.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD4=>IMAGES.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD5=>MARKER.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD6=>POLYGONS.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD7=>POLYPOLY.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD8=>SHAPES.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD9=>SPECLEFX.RIP$
!|!             
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Where should we go when we click on the "back" button?
!|! 
!|10000$-=BACK=>TELDEMOS.RET$
!|!
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Define the status messages displayed when the user hovers over one of
!|! the mouse fields on the screen
!|!
!|10000$=-MSG1=Buttons objecs for user interaction$
!|10000$=-MSG2=Complex Bezier curve shapes$
!|10000$=-MSG3=Fonts, fonts and more fonts$
!|10000$=-MSG4=Images, bitmaps and wallpaper$
!|10000$=-MSG5=Built-in marker style objects$
!|10000$=-MSG6=Multi-faceted objects - polygons and polylines$
!|10000$=-MSG7=Complex polygons - the poly-polygon$
!|10000$=-MSG8=Basic geometric shapes$
!|10000$=-MSG9=Awesome special effects using drawing ports$
!|!             
!|10000$=-MSG10=Return to the demo menu$
!|!
!|!
